  "description": "Amflow PX integrates 150N·m of maximum torque and 1500W of peak power into the compact Avinox M2S Drive Unit. Backed by a 700Wh high-capacity premium battery, it delivers a new answer to the ultimate performance balance between power, range, and weight.\n\nAmflow PX's sleek, lightweight build conceals immense power. With an ultra-light carbon fiber frame weighing just 2.4kg, this electric mountain bike delivers precise, effortless handling.\n\nSurging Power, Naturally Refined\n\nThe Avinox M2S Drive Unit uses sensors and smart algorithms for linear pedaling feel, with up to 150N·m max. torque.\n\nWhisper-Quiet, Immersive Riding\n\nInnovative compound planetary gears and a helical gear design reduce operating noise to as low as 45dBA for a quieter, more immersive ride.\n\nCharge Fast, Ride Free\n\nA 700Wh high-capacity battery paired with 3x super-fast charging supports all-day epic rides and helps eliminates range anxiety.\n\nVersatile Geometry To Conquer Any Terrain\n\nWith up to 40 geometry combinations , it fine-tunes head tube angle, bottom bracket height, and chainstay length to suit different trails and riding styles.\n\nCompact, More Capable\n\nAt 2.59kg , the Avinox M2S Drive Unit boosts torque density by 21.6% compared to the previous generation.\n\nSmart Offline Navigation\n\nThe Avinox Ride app imports third-party routes and turns ride history into route files for one-click ride data synchronization.",
